02:03:04,840 --> 02:03:06,560
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: Tapos na po si UniFAST.

1703
02:03:07,120 --> 02:03:11,360
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: At in fact, yung sinasabi kayo ng SGV, that is the firm contracted by UniFAST.

1704
02:03:11,680 --> 02:03:15,260
