PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: This is our proposal for SUCs whose tuition fees are 100 pesos and below.

1718
02:04:49,660 --> 02:04:50,300
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: We propose.

1719
02:04:50,380 --> 02:04:56,920
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: 100 or 200 peso increase per unit.

1720
02:04:57,440 --> 02:05:09,640
PASUC President Dr. Tirso A. Ronquillo: And for SUCs whose tuition fee is from 100 pesos to 300 pesos, we are proposing 150 pesos per unit increase.

1721
