2576
02:51:47,600 --> 02:51:50,340
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: Ayun po.

2577
02:51:50,340 --> 02:51:56,580
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: kakatanggap lang po namin ng pondo through the PISARO.

2578
02:51:57,580 --> 02:51:59,520
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: So we just received it I think a month ago.

2579
02:52:00,960 --> 02:52:04,800
PGH Director Dr. Gerardo D. Legaspi: But so far this morning of the 800 million po,

2580
