Senator Joel Villanueva: Isa na lang, right?

5160
04:52:18,600 --> 04:52:25,120
Senator Joel Villanueva: You know, I, I, I, this is very personal for me because I have a kid who is...

5161
04:52:25,120 --> 04:52:30,240
Senator Joel Villanueva: in the spectrum, alam ni Doc Gapto.

5162
04:52:30,620 --> 04:52:34,960
Senator Joel Villanueva: Hindi po pwedeng, kasi wala doon sa law yung specialization eh, diba?

5163
04:52:35,500 --> 04:52:39,620
Senator Joel Villanueva: And we were tackling the budget of DOH last time.

5164
04:52:39,720 --> 04:52:47,460
Senator Joel Villanueva: And when we, when we were deliberating on the budget, on the bill ng doktor para sa bayan law,

5165
04:52:48,420 --> 04:52:54,720
Senator Joel Villanueva: I remember distinctly there are 209 municipalities with zero doctors during that time.

5166
04:52:55,120 --> 04:53:00,660
Senator Joel Villanueva: And then in regions, there were only like seven regions or eight.

5167
04:53:00,660 --> 04:53:03,920
Senator Joel Villanueva: And ngayon lahat meron na, except NIR na lang.

5168
04:53:04,000 --> 04:53:06,660
Senator Joel Villanueva: Napag-usapan na namin ni Dr. Tirso, you...

5169
04:53:07,300 --> 04:53:09,660
Senator Joel Villanueva: I forgot the name of the president ng...

5170
04:53:10,220 --> 04:53:12,120
Senator Joel Villanueva: Norsoo.

5171
04:53:12,440 --> 04:53:15,040
Senator Joel Villanueva: So yun na lang, ang hinihintay natin.

5172
04:53:15,160 --> 04:53:22,660
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ang tinatanong ko lang po is, kasi wala doon sa law natin yung specialization hanggang doon sa general...

5173
04:53:23,240 --> 04:53:24,660
Senator Joel Villanueva: But perhaps if we can...

5174
04:53:25,120 --> 04:53:29,460
Senator Joel Villanueva: do an exemption or perhaps come up with something.

5175
04:53:29,580 --> 04:53:31,400
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi medyo glaring na po.

5176
04:53:31,900 --> 04:53:38,160
Senator Joel Villanueva: For example, yung medical practitioners, child development.

5177
04:53:38,880 --> 04:53:42,600
Senator Joel Villanueva: I remember, ako ho personally, na-experience ko po ito.

5178
04:53:43,000 --> 04:53:47,480
Senator Joel Villanueva: Dadalawa lang yung doktor na nakilala ho dito.

5179
04:53:47,480 --> 04:53:54,000
Senator Joel Villanueva: Si Dr. Di Malanta ng St. Louis at si Dr. Lexie Reyes.

5180
04:53:55,120 --> 04:53:56,440
Senator Joel Villanueva: Na makatimed.

5181
04:53:57,240 --> 04:54:03,040
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pagka po yung bata maghihingi ng appointment,

5182
04:54:04,000 --> 04:54:06,300
Senator Joel Villanueva: one year.

5183
04:54:06,740 --> 04:54:08,240
Senator Joel Villanueva: You have to wait for one year.

5184
04:54:09,140 --> 04:54:14,180
Senator Joel Villanueva: Eh, nung isang araw po, nandun ako sa Minuyan Elementary School, doon po sa San Jose del Monte.

5185
04:54:15,000 --> 04:54:18,540
Senator Joel Villanueva: At sinek ko yung SPED program ng Department of Education.

5186
04:54:18,640 --> 04:54:22,900
Senator Joel Villanueva: And I already reported this to Secretary Angara.

5187
04:54:23,240 --> 04:54:24,900
Senator Joel Villanueva: There are about 100...

5188
04:54:25,120 --> 04:54:31,640
Senator Joel Villanueva: 38 special kids doon po sa SPED program sa Minuyan Elementary School.

5189
04:54:32,100 --> 04:54:33,500
Senator Joel Villanueva: Dadalawa lang ho yung teacher.

5190
04:54:34,240 --> 04:54:44,840
Senator Joel Villanueva: And tinanong ko ho kung meron silang experience or they were able to at least somehow may diagnosis na yung mga bata.

5191
04:54:45,020 --> 04:54:45,860
Senator Joel Villanueva: Wala ni isa.

5192
04:54:46,800 --> 04:54:48,800
Senator Joel Villanueva: Nakamit ho ako ng isang parent doon.

5193
04:54:48,920 --> 04:54:51,640
Senator Joel Villanueva: Tatlo yung anak niya na part ng SPED.

5194
04:54:53,240 --> 04:54:54,600
Senator Joel Villanueva: Eh, ako na ho mismo.

5195
04:54:54,600 --> 04:54:55,600
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sasabihin ko sa inyo.

5196
04:54:55,680 --> 04:54:56,720
Senator Joel Villanueva: Senador na po ako.

5197
04:54:57,100 --> 04:54:58,860
Senator Joel Villanueva: Eh, hindi ko ako makakita eh.

5198
04:54:59,860 --> 04:55:03,280
Senator Joel Villanueva: Nang developmental doctor eh.

5199
04:55:03,800 --> 04:55:05,020
Senator Joel Villanueva: Dito sa Pilipinas.

5200
04:55:06,140 --> 04:55:08,900
Senator Joel Villanueva: Now, you want to go further ng problema?

5201
04:55:09,640 --> 04:55:10,060
Senator Joel Villanueva: PTs.

5202
04:55:10,780 --> 04:55:12,080
Senator Joel Villanueva: Occupational Therapies.

5203
04:55:12,200 --> 04:55:13,440
Senator Joel Villanueva: Speech Therapies.

5204
04:55:14,540 --> 04:55:19,640
Senator Joel Villanueva: Speech Therapy ko parang took me like four months bago ako ma-accommodate eh.

5205
04:55:19,840 --> 04:55:20,600
Senator Joel Villanueva: Four months.

5206
04:55:21,540 --> 04:55:22,980
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, iniisip ko lang ho.

5207
04:55:23,480 --> 04:55:24,580
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ah, hindi naman tayo.

5208
04:55:24,680 --> 04:55:32,120
Senator Joel Villanueva: Dapat siguro makulong sa isang box especially with this glaring problems that we are facing right now.

5209
04:55:32,820 --> 04:55:35,940
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yung developmental pediatrician.

5210
04:55:36,620 --> 04:55:47,400
Senator Joel Villanueva: Baka pwedeng masama natin sa scholarship program or kung merong program na, I mean, ng UP meron eh.

5211
04:55:47,500 --> 04:55:48,880
Senator Joel Villanueva: UP-USD, di ba?

5212
04:55:49,780 --> 04:55:53,480
Senator Joel Villanueva: Baka pwede tayong magkaroon ng item for that.

5213
04:55:53,480 --> 04:55:54,480
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ah, your honor.

5214
04:55:54,600 --> 04:55:54,760
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ah, your honor.

5215
04:55:55,980 --> 04:55:58,620
Senator Joel Villanueva: Matulungan nyo kami, ah, President Gigi.

5216
04:55:58,760 --> 04:56:01,220
Senator Joel Villanueva: Baka pwedeng matulungan nyo kami, President Gigi, no?

5217
04:56:01,560 --> 04:56:08,280
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ah, pwedeng tayong mag-alot ng funding for scholarship for that particular item habang hinihintay natin.

5218
04:56:08,360 --> 04:56:10,880
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi kung gagawa pa tayong batas, medyo matagal eh.

5219
04:56:11,200 --> 04:56:17,700
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mahirap na, ano, siguro let's be proactive in this particular issue.

5220
04:56:18,300 --> 04:56:18,780
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, yun po.

5221
04:56:18,880 --> 04:56:20,660
Senator Joel Villanueva: Yun lang po yung aking request.

5222
04:56:20,820 --> 04:56:23,280
Senator Joel Villanueva: Matulungan nyo kami dito sa subcommittee.

5223
04:56:23,820 --> 04:56:24,300
Senator Joel Villanueva: Anyway,

5224
04:56:24,600 --> 04:56:26,960
Senator Joel Villanueva: ang ating chairperson, Senator JV.

5225
04:56:27,140 --> 04:56:28,400
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kita nyo naman, nandito pa rin.

5226
04:56:29,280 --> 04:56:32,180
Senator Joel Villanueva: Ah, dalawa na lang siguro kaming senador na narin dito.

5227
04:56:32,880 --> 04:56:34,740
Senator Joel Villanueva: Alas otso pa ho kami ng umaga dito.

5228
04:56:35,120 --> 04:56:40,560
Senator Joel Villanueva: Pareho po kaming membro ng Commission on Appointments na merong tatlong committee hearings kanina

5229
04:56:40,560 --> 04:56:47,240
Senator Joel Villanueva: at nag-plenary session at nag-conduct ng hearings dito sa Senado.

5230
04:56:47,240 --> 04:56:54,560
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kaya we appreciate the presence of our Senate chairperson of the Committee on Finance.

5231
04:56:54,600 --> 04:56:57,300
Senator Joel Villanueva: So, maraming salamat po sa inyong lahat.

5232
04:56:57,460 --> 04:57:02,120
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mr. Chairman, I will welcome any motion.

5233
04:57:02,860 --> 04:57:04,900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, thank you, Senator Joel.

5234
04:57:05,040 --> 04:57:08,340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Anyway, thank you to the KSUC families.

5235
04:57:08,660 --> 04:57:14,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I know it's been a long day pero yung pong reduction nyo last year, we were conferring.

5236
04:57:14,660 --> 04:57:24,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi nawala sa atin yung luxury kasi last year merong flood control na 250 billion na may luxury na pinamahagi sa iba.

5237
04:57:24,600 --> 04:57:25,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But ibang departments.

5238
04:57:25,780 --> 04:57:28,280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And yung CHED was one of those.

5239
04:57:28,440 --> 04:57:29,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya po nagkaroon tayo na ano.

5240
04:57:29,900 --> 04:57:34,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But we will do our best para matis mahabol natin yung nawala sa inyo.

5241
04:57:35,240 --> 04:57:41,680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Because the last thing, we will always treat, dapat investment ang tingin natin lagi sa inyong education.

5242
04:57:41,680 --> 04:57:46,320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Be rest assured that masigip man, may yung elbow room natin is really limited.

5243
04:57:46,520 --> 04:57:47,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But we will do our part.

5244
04:57:48,400 --> 04:57:49,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We will do our best.

5245
04:57:50,340 --> 04:57:53,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And di na alam ko, gabi na masyado.

5246
04:57:53,560 --> 04:57:54,500
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero ano lang.

5247
04:57:54,600 --> 04:57:58,120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, Senator Joel, marami dito.

5248
04:57:58,500 --> 04:57:59,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Natanong na rin kanina.

5249
04:57:59,820 --> 04:58:00,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Dapat sinagma.

5250
04:58:02,260 --> 04:58:05,760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Anyway, UP also got a significant cut.

5251
04:58:06,080 --> 04:58:08,520
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Agni at Atty. G.G. is here.

5252
04:58:09,020 --> 04:58:10,780
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: UP PGH din kasama.

5253
04:58:11,080 --> 04:58:13,720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But we'll deal with it differently nalang.

5254
04:58:13,820 --> 04:58:15,100
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi po yun sa health naman.

5255
04:58:15,200 --> 04:58:15,860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Alam ko health yun.

5256
04:58:15,940 --> 04:58:17,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But under kayo ng UP.

5257
04:58:18,560 --> 04:58:21,800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung sa maipip nyo, lahat we'll try to.

5258
04:58:22,360 --> 04:58:23,600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We will try.

5259
04:58:23,660 --> 04:58:27,980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We are committed to increase para makatulong din sa patients.

5260
04:58:28,160 --> 04:58:34,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And initially, I wanted siguro, Doc Gap, yung initial investment nyo po doon sa Carbona.

5261
04:58:35,140 --> 04:58:37,380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So that we can help also.

5262
04:58:38,060 --> 04:58:41,000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Alam ko, UP, PUP, lahat nagkaroon ng significant cuts.

5263
04:58:41,120 --> 04:58:41,880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But we will try.

5264
04:58:42,500 --> 04:58:43,580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We will look into it.

5265
04:58:44,860 --> 04:58:53,160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I'm, I'm, I'm, be rest assured that we will, kami na Sen. Joel, we will always support higher education.

5266
04:58:53,160 --> 04:58:54,740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: We will support the SUCs.

5267
04:58:54,940 --> 04:58:58,480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Hindi man natin kayang lahatin, but we will do our best, na?

5268
04:58:58,600 --> 04:58:58,820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay?

5269
04:58:59,340 --> 04:59:12,940
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, Mr. Chair, with that, I move that the, the budget of the Commission on Higher Education, the SUCs, be approved under this committee and submitted to the plenary.

5270
04:59:13,760 --> 04:59:14,820
Senator Joel Villanueva: Thank you very much.

5271
04:59:16,080 --> 04:59:22,280
Senator Joel Villanueva: The fiscal year 2027 proposed budget of the Commission on Higher Education.

5272
04:59:23,160 --> 04:59:31,380
Senator Joel Villanueva: State universities and colleges and the University of the Philippines System are hereby submitted for plenary consideration.

5273
04:59:31,380 --> 04:59:41,000
Senator Joel Villanueva: Of course, subject to the discussions held today and the submission of the documents and information requested by our distinguished colleagues.

5274
04:59:41,420 --> 04:59:43,240
Senator Joel Villanueva: Sa inyo pong lahat, maraming salamat.

5275
04:59:44,460 --> 04:59:48,560
Senator Joel Villanueva: Special thank you sa mga SUC presidents na naririto.

5276
04:59:48,680 --> 04:59:50,260
Senator Joel Villanueva: Maraming salamat po sa inyong lahat.

5277
04:59:50,360 --> 04:59:51,060
Senator Joel Villanueva: God bless you all.

5278
04:59:51,420 --> 04:59:52,280
Senator Joel Villanueva: Mabuhay po kayo.

5279
04:59:53,160 --> 05:00:00,000
Senator Joel Villanueva: There being no other matters to discuss, this budget briefing

5280
05:00:00,000 --> 05:00:01,840
Senator Joel Villanueva: is hereby suspended.

5281
05:00:02,040 --> 05:00:02,780
Senator Joel Villanueva: Maraming salamat po.

5282
05:00:02,860 --> 05:00:03,560
Senator Joel Villanueva: God bless you all.

